   "body": "Operator decision 2026-10-28: one-to-one and multi-participant MPs can be split. That is the follow-up lot **LOT-171 (#297)** (setting \"Tout en un\" by default / \"Deux listes\", switch \"MP\" / \"MP multiples\" at the top of Messages, group MPs read like topics). This lot stays the single list, which is LOT-171's default.\n\nAcceptance criteria added here:\n- [ ] The list model exposes `PrivateMessageThread.isGroup` per row and the unread count per row, so LOT-171 can split and count without refetching.\n- [ ] The Messages entry is the Messages tab of the legacy bottom bar once LOT-170 (#296) lands.",
